flowchart LR
    %% PawPal+ AI system architecture: RAG + scheduling agent

    User([Pet Owner]) -->|request| UI[Streamlit UI<br/>app.py]

    subgraph AI["AI Layer"]
        Agent[Planning Agent]
        Retriever[Retriever]
        KB[(Pet Care<br/>Knowledge Base)]
        Retriever --> KB
    end

    subgraph Core["Core Logic (pawpal_system.py)"]
        Scheduler[Scheduler]
        Data[Owner / Pet / Task]
        Scheduler --> Data
    end

    Guard{Guardrails<br/>validate plan}

    UI --> Agent
    Agent -->|look up care tips| Retriever
    Agent -->|build schedule| Scheduler
    Agent --> Guard
    Guard -->|pass| UI
    Guard -->|fail: retry| Agent

    Tests[[pytest tests]] -.->|verify| Scheduler
    Tests -.->|verify| Guard
